(6831910, 1027831, 135629, '<td valign="top">At first glance it almost looks like the flowers are spraying the water into the air, mainly because the long stems mixed in with the drops gave it that motion... to my overactive imagination anyway :) I enjoy images that make me take a closer look, so thanks for that. I am having a hard time pegging it as vintage, but a fine image anyway :) Good luck.</td>', 'At first glance it almost looks like the flowers are spraying the water into the air, mainly because the long stems mixed in with the drops gave it that motion... to my overactive imagination anyway :) I enjoy images that make me take a closer look, so thanks for that. I am having a hard time pegging it as vintage, but a fine image anyway :) Good luck.', '2012-08-01 00:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
