(6835633, 1027516, 96751, '<td valign="top">You have assembled a terrific collection of vintage artifacts (the fan, espresso machine, newspaper, outfit), and yet if still feels sterile to me - they just look placed, not used. Perhaps it''s the all white room in which he sits, but I don''t feel any sort of emotion, especially given the headline.</td>', 'You have assembled a terrific collection of vintage artifacts (the fan, espresso machine, newspaper, outfit), and yet if still feels sterile to me - they just look placed, not used. Perhaps it''s the all white room in which he sits, but I don''t feel any sort of emotion, especially given the headline.', '2012-08-05 21:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6835634, 1026810, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ann Geddes takes a trip in a time machine. This will get the sentimental voters.  LOVE the diaper.</td>', 'Ann Geddes takes a trip in a time machine. This will get the sentimental voters.  LOVE the diaper.', '2012-08-05 21:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
