(6836398, 1027804, 112739, '<td valign="top">Tom- This is a really great set up and shot. Maybe the shot looks too clean, but it has the right amount of Vintage subjects. I can''t believe you didn''t get any comments! I didn''t even look through the entries this time. Rare, but true.</td>', 'Tom- This is a really great set up and shot. Maybe the shot looks too clean, but it has the right amount of Vintage subjects. I can''t believe you didn''t get any comments! I didn''t even look through the entries this time. Rare, but true.', '2012-08-06 21:49:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836404, 1027820, 28742, '<td valign="top">You''re in a league your own, Wendy. ;-) Congratulations!</td>', 'You''re in a league your own, Wendy. ;-) Congratulations!', '2012-08-06 21:53:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836407, 1027823, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very well done, well deserved! Congratulations!</td>', 'Very well done, well deserved! Congratulations!', '2012-08-06 21:53:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836408, 1027612, 28742, '<td valign="top">Superb! Congrats, Jenn!</td>', 'Superb! Congrats, Jenn!', '2012-08-06 21:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836411, 1027874, 28742, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2012-08-06 21:55:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836423, 1027516, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> You have assembled a terrific collection of vintage artifacts (the fan, espresso machine, newspaper, outfit), and yet if still feels sterile to me - they just look placed, not used. Perhaps it''s the all white room in which he sits, but I don''t feel any sort of emotion, especially given the headline. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Wow, soooo mean, Johanna. :P (kidding) - these were my thoughts when I first saw the image as well. One thing that may have made a difference is the James Dean photo and the fan - just look like they were pulled out and placed there for the photo. All that aside, the lighting and all the technicals are stunningly perfect! And the processing is spot-on.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: You have assembled a terrific collection of vintage artifacts (the fan, espresso machine, newspaper, outfit), and yet if still feels sterile to me - they just look placed, not used. Perhaps it''s the all white room in which he sits, but I don''t feel any sort of emotion, especially given the headline.  Wow, soooo mean, Johanna. :P (kidding) - these were my thoughts when I first saw the image as well. One thing that may have made a difference is the James Dean photo and the fan - just look like they were pulled out and placed there for the photo. All that aside, the lighting and all the technicals are stunningly perfect! And the processing is spot-on.', '2012-08-06 21:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836425, 1027615, 28742, '<td valign="top">Love the muted color and the grain - outstanding job!</td>', 'Love the muted color and the grain - outstanding job!', '2012-08-06 22:00:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836426, 1027611, 28742, '<td valign="top">Fan-freaking-tastic!</td>', 'Fan-freaking-tastic!', '2012-08-06 22:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836446, 1027467, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well done, Johanna!</td>', 'Well done, Johanna!', '2012-08-06 22:12:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836454, 1027511, 68504, '<td valign="top">I can''t look at this without feeling ccoated with atmosphere.</td>', 'I can''t look at this without feeling ccoated with atmosphere.', '2012-08-06 22:21:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836456, 1027467, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Sherpet award. This really is a nostalgic image. My hat boxes have been unopened on the top shelf for years. And the clock nuance is brilliant.</td>', 'Congrats on your Sherpet award. This really is a nostalgic image. My hat boxes have been unopened on the top shelf for years. And the clock nuance is brilliant.', '2012-08-06 22:35:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836461, 1027815, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great perspective on the old windmill.</td>', 'Great perspective on the old windmill.', '2012-08-06 22:42:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6836515, 1027615, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Awesome!<br/></td>', 'Wow.  Awesome!', '2012-08-07 01:14:14.000000', NULL, 0);
